flowchart LR
  Sources[Source adapters\nWorkbench / Process / Workflow / Files / Plugins] --> Ingest[Ingestion + canonicalization]
  Ingest --> Bind[Schema + entity + context binding]
  Bind --> Claims[Claim / evidence / belief ledger]
  Claims --> Items[Canonical memory items\nchunks, relations, summaries]
  Items --> Proj[Projection builders]
  Proj --> Qdrant[Qdrant / vector projection]

  Workspace[Cognitive workspace\nfocus slots + goal stack] <--> Attention[Attention router]
  Attention --> Recall[Recall orchestrator]
  Recall --> Qdrant
  Recall --> Items
  Recall --> Claims
  Recall --> Gate[Metamemory answer gate]
  Gate --> Answer[Answer / warning / ask / probe / abstain]

  Probe[Interactive probing] --> Workspace
  Probe --> PredErr[Prediction error engine]
  Workflows[Workflows + process runs + QA] --> PredErr
  PredErr --> Signals[Salience signal ledger]
  Signals --> Attention
  Signals --> Replay[Replay scheduler]
  Signals --> Drive[Epistemic Drive]
  Replay --> Consolidation[Consolidation engine]
  Consolidation --> Claims
  Consolidation --> Items
  Drive --> Proposals[Learning proposals]

  Procedures[Procedure skill memory] --> Recall
  Procedures --> Gate
  Consolidation --> Procedures
